why-is-a-tire-rotation-important&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="why-is-a-tire-rotation-important">Why is a Tire Rotation Important?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_a_-why-is-a-tire-rotation-important?-1-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_a_-why-is-a-tire-rotation-important?-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_a_-why-is-a-tire-rotation-important?-1" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_a_-why-is-a-tire-rotation-important?-1" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Your tires may wear differently, depending on their position on your vehicle, your driving style, and the condition of your suspension. This uneven wear can lead to poor performance and decreased mileage.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Rotating your tires helps distribute tire wear more evenly, leading to better mileage and maximized traction on all four wheels.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"></p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_a_-what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires?-2"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_a_-what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires?-2" id="accordion-header-_r_a_-what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires?-2" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_a_-what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires?-2" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires">What Does it Mean to Rotate Tires?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_a_-what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires?-2-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_a_-what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires?-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_a_-what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires?-2" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_a_-what-does-it-mean-to-rotate-tires?-2" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">All four tires of your vehicle are the only parts touching the ground. Having your tires rotated helps to prolong the tire’s tread life by promoting more uniform tread wear on all four tires.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Routine rotations will also help to have the four tires be replaced at once, rather than in a pair at different times. The key is having the front tires match the rear tires which will help the tire’s handling when driving.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"></p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_a_-how-often-do-tires-need-rotated?-3"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_a_-how-often-do-tires-need-rotated?-3" id="accordion-header-_r_a_-how-often-do-tires-need-rotated?-3" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_a_-how-often-do-tires-need-rotated?-3" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:how-often-do-tires-need-rotated&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="how-often-do-tires-need-rotated">How Often Do Tires Need Rotated?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_a_-how-often-do-tires-need-rotated?-3-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_a_-how-often-do-tires-need-rotated?-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_a_-how-often-do-tires-need-rotated?-3" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_a_-how-often-do-tires-need-rotated?-3" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Tire rotation is a routine maintenance service that should be performed every 3,000 to 6,000 miles.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case"></p></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-2 last:border-b-2 text-type-standard  border-background-100 border-background-100" data-open="false" data-qa-id="accordion-item-_r_a_-what’s-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service?-4"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-_r_a_-what’s-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service?-4" id="accordion-header-_r_a_-what’s-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service?-4" class="py-4 pr-6 pl-0 cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center w-full border-none text-left gap-6 capitalize bg-transparent paragraph-lg text-type-standard  border-t-background-100 text-type-standard" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-header-_r_a_-what’s-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service?-4" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:whats-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;componentType&quot;:&quot;accordion-container&quot;,&quot;componentName&quot;:&quot;accordion-container|accordion-summary&quot;,&quot;componentElement&quot;:&quot;button&quot;,&quot;productListAdds&quot;:false}"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="heading-xs !normal-case text-type-standard" id="whats-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service">What’s Included with a Tire Rotation Service?</h3></div><span class="transition-transform duration-300 ease-out flex items-center ml-auto"><i class="icon-chevron-down flex justify-center items-center icon-md " aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-summary-_r_a_-what’s-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service?-4-icon-chevron" style="font-size: 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; color: currentcolor;"><span class="path1"></span><span class="path2"></span><span class="path3"></span><span class="path4"></span><span class="path5"></span><span class="path6"></span><span class="path7"></span><span class="path8"></span><span class="path9"></span><span class="path10"></span><span class="path11"></span><span class="path12"></span><span class="path13"></span><span class="path14"></span></i></span></button><div id="accordion-content-_r_a_-what’s-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service?-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-header-_r_a_-what’s-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service?-4" class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-300 ease-in pb-0 px-0 pb-6" aria-hidden="true" data-qa-id="accordion-details-_r_a_-what’s-included-with-a-tire-rotation-service?-4" style="overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s; display: none; height: 0px;"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="text-black last:mb-0"><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">First, our tire technicians will carefully evaluate the position of your tires and the wear they’ve sustained to determine if it’s time for a rotation.</p><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">If, based on our recommendation, you decide on a rotation, our next step will be to help preserve the life of your tires with a service that includes:</p><ul class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 !normal-case mb-2"><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case"> Removing your tires</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case"> Carefully inspecting their tread-wear patterns</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case"> Rotating your tires to the positions recommended by your vehicle manufacturer</li><li class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary m-0 mb-2 !normal-case"> Resetting your tire-pressure monitoring system (TPMS) as needed</li></ul><p class="paragraph-md text-action-color-secondary !normal-case">Learn more about our <a href="index.html" type="button" data-tracking="{&quot;eventType&quot;:&quot;web.webinteraction.linkClicks&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;cta:accordion-container:rich-text:link&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;ot